          "title": "Dashboard Description",
          "text": {
            "content": "This dashboard provides an overview of the service accross all the regions\n\nThe following details can be found:\n1. Health of the Data Plane - clusters and Control Plane (Historical)\n2. Capacity Avaliable/Used\n3. Total Requests by Customers\n4. Error Rate in Control Plane workflows\n5. Latency Accross the service (CP and DP)",
